# Detection

Successful Logons

## Objective

Review successful Windows authentication events.

## Analyst Question

Which users authenticated successfully during the investigation window?

## Data Source

Windows Security Log

Event ID 4624

## SPL

```spl
index=main EventCode=4624
| table _time Account_Name Logon_Type Authentication_Package host
| sort _time
```

## Expected Output

A chronological list of successful authentication events.

## Investigation Notes

Correlating successful logons with previous authentication failures provides valuable context during brute-force investigations.
